sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor T as Teacher
    actor AD as Admin
    participant B as React Client
    participant A as Express API
    participant D as Data Store

    T->>B: Open Marks Entry (exam, class, subject)
    B->>A: GET /api/exams/:id/sheet
    A->>D: Read students + existing marks
    D-->>A: Roll list with marks
    A-->>B: 200 {sheet}

    T->>B: Enter marks, Save Draft
    B->>A: PUT /api/exams/sheet (status: draft)
    A->>D: upsert marks
    A-->>B: 200 saved

    T->>B: Submit sheet
    B->>A: PUT /api/exams/sheet (status: submitted)
    A->>D: update sheetStatus
    A-->>B: 200 locked for teacher

    AD->>B: Review submitted sheets
    B->>A: POST /api/exams/:id/publish
    A->>D: set exam status = published
    D-->>A: OK
    A-->>B: 200 published

    Note over B,D: Students & parents can now view results,<br/>download report cards and hall tickets
